332
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:43,000
Consider it my treat.

333
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:47,720
Mr. Li,

334
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:49,960
if you change your mind,

335
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:52,360
let us know your conditions, thoughts, and requirements

336
00:14:52,600 --> 00:14:53,480
up front.

337
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:55,080
We'll do our best to work with your team.

338
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:58,600
We purposely flew here for a collaboration.

339
00:14:58,600 --> 00:15:00,840
If you are free, you may let us know.

340
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:03,960
We'll have a chance to work together in the future.

341
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:11,840
Should we go after him?

342
00:15:12,600 --> 00:15:13,510
Go after him?

343
00:15:14,910 --> 00:15:15,510
Just wait.

344
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:22,080
Luke.

345
00:15:22,510 --> 00:15:24,750
Should we find another team as a backup?

346
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:30,600
A supply and demand relationship decides our bargaining chip.

347
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:32,480
Lumi,

348
00:15:33,030 --> 00:15:34,960
