361
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:01,000
Can he deal with this?

362
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:01,750
Yes.

363
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:04,510
Do you trust him so much?

364
00:16:04,630 --> 00:16:05,600
Of course.

365
00:16:05,790 --> 00:16:06,600
When it comes to work,

366
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:07,840
