367
00:16:13,240 --> 00:16:13,840
Sure.

368
00:16:14,600 --> 00:16:17,080
Please send the relevant information to my inbox.

369
00:16:20,630 --> 00:16:21,360
Thank you.

370
00:16:23,460 --> 00:16:25,420
[Laiyu's information]

371
00:16:25,420 --> 00:16:29,020
[Tian Zheng's personal information]

372
00:16:31,220 --> 00:16:34,180
[Want to become an extra? Tian Zheng is shooting a commercial. Join now!]

373
00:16:34,180 --> 00:16:37,060
