385
00:17:08,830 --> 00:17:10,880
There's also a new automobile brand from Germany.

386
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,960
Not long ago, they tried to secure a partnership with Tmall,

387
00:17:14,070 --> 00:17:14,880
