388
00:17:16,070 --> 00:17:16,720
Look.

389
00:17:17,110 --> 00:17:19,000
Go and focus on getting the Taobao project.

390
00:17:19,480 --> 00:17:20,070
All right.

391
00:17:24,310 --> 00:17:25,440
Where's Shang Zhitao?

392
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:39,720
What are you doing?

393
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:40,720
We are going to brief the extras.

394
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:41,350
Why are you running around?

395
00:17:41,350 --> 00:17:42,240
Get back immediately.

396
00:17:44,790 --> 00:17:45,480
Sure.

397
00:17:54,070 --> 00:17:55,790
That scene just now. I think...

398
00:18:17,340 --> 00:18:19,060
[Lumi]

399
00:18:21,270 --> 00:18:22,510
Flora, where are you?

400
00:18:22,720 --> 00:18:23,640
Lumi.

401
00:18:23,830 --> 00:18:24,510
I...

402
00:18:24,600 --> 00:18:26,510
