403
00:18:26,830 --> 00:18:27,720
Filming set?

404
00:18:29,280 --> 00:18:31,130
I'm here as an extra.

405
00:18:31,350 --> 00:18:32,960
I saw the director just now.

406
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:34,510
I wanted to see

407
00:18:34,720 --> 00:18:36,160
