408
00:18:36,350 --> 00:18:37,830
Use this opportunity to ask the director.

409
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:39,000
Tell him

410
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:40,480
you have a Taobao project to work on.

411
00:18:40,510 --> 00:18:41,750
Ask him if he's interested.

412
00:18:41,750 --> 00:18:42,270
I...

413
00:18:44,030 --> 00:18:45,200
Can I ask him directly?

414
00:18:45,440 --> 00:18:46,310
Ask him directly.

415
00:18:46,310 --> 00:18:47,440
I'll take full responsibility if something happens.

416
00:18:47,510 --> 00:18:48,510
No one will blame you.

417
00:18:50,200 --> 00:18:50,790
All right.

418
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:58,480
It was an exciting performance.

419
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:02,000
I'll call everyone here at lunchtime

420
00:19:02,480 --> 00:19:03,960
to talk about

421
00:19:04,160 --> 00:19:05,640
