422
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:08,030
For the next scene...

423
00:19:08,510 --> 00:19:09,310
Director,

424
00:19:10,110 --> 00:19:11,960
I am Shang Zhitao from Lime Advertising.

425
00:19:12,510 --> 00:19:13,200
Hello.

426
00:19:16,350 --> 00:19:17,380
Not bad.

427
00:19:17,750 --> 00:19:19,240
I didn't expect you to be so smart.

428
00:19:20,070 --> 00:19:22,240
I thought I couldn't help much.

429
00:19:22,440 --> 00:19:24,680
Since Luke wanted to know more about the director,

430
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:26,790
I rushed to the set to take a look.

431
00:19:31,270 --> 00:19:32,240
Lumi.

432
00:19:32,310 --> 00:19:33,310
Why aren't

433
00:19:33,680 --> 00:19:34,960
