434
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:36,030
It's fine.

435
00:19:36,510 --> 00:19:37,440
He knows what to do.

436
00:19:40,510 --> 00:19:41,920
You went over my head

437
00:19:42,550 --> 00:19:44,000
and spoke to the director immediately.

438
00:19:44,550 --> 00:19:45,680
Impressive.

439
00:19:45,920 --> 00:19:48,510
Do you think I can't deal with your trick?

440
00:19:49,510 --> 00:19:50,240
Mr. Li,

441
00:19:50,920 --> 00:19:51,790
in business,

442
00:19:52,510 --> 00:19:53,510
we always have to look forward.

443
00:19:54,030 --> 00:19:55,510
If this project is a success,

444
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:57,720
and the filming of the commercial is completed,

445
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:00,750
your team will truly

446
00:20:00,750 --> 00:20:03,030
be the best commercial production team in Guangzhou.

447
00:20:03,200 --> 00:20:05,790
However, if you're stuck in the past

448
00:20:06,240 --> 00:20:07,920
and give up on a top-tier client,

449
00:20:08,400 --> 00:20:09,160
it won't be worth it.

450
00:20:16,830 --> 00:20:18,400
I'm betting

451
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:20,160
that within ten seconds,

452
00:20:20,160 --> 00:20:22,440
Mr. Li will give in.

453
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:31,030
Taobao's annual project...

454
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:35,590
I'll do my best.

455
00:20:36,790 --> 00:20:38,200
Then, let's wipe the slate clean

456
00:20:38,590 --> 00:20:39,720
regarding what happened before.

457
00:20:40,720 --> 00:20:41,550
To a successful partnership.

458
00:20:41,550 --> 00:20:42,420
To a successful partnership.

459
00:20:51,070 --> 00:20:52,310
See?

460
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:55,720
This is his charm despite being so stubborn.

461
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:59,070
Why is he so amazing?

462
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:00,680
One,

463
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:02,070
he's vicious.

464
00:21:02,680 --> 00:21:03,750
He's vicious to himself,

465
00:21:03,750 --> 00:21:05,000
and he's even more vicious to the clients.

466
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:06,000
Two,

467
00:21:06,200 --> 00:21:07,240
he's wise.

468
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:08,590
He knows when to advance

469
00:21:08,590 --> 00:21:09,830
and when to take a step back.

470
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:11,200
Three,

471
00:21:11,200 --> 00:21:12,160
he's cold.

472
00:21:12,160 --> 00:21:13,720
No one knows what he is thinking.

473
00:21:13,790 --> 00:21:15,440
That makes them want to win him over.

474
00:21:15,440 --> 00:21:16,680
Isn't that crazy?

475
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:20,270
He sounds like

476
00:21:21,590 --> 00:21:22,920
