477
00:21:22,920 --> 00:21:25,750
There's no hero or villain in the workplace.

478
00:21:26,440 --> 00:21:28,270
Only winners and losers.

479
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:28,920
Luan Nian

480
00:21:29,200 --> 00:21:30,400
