481
00:21:31,160 --> 00:21:32,920
If you want to learn things,

482
00:21:32,920 --> 00:21:34,270
you need to work under him.

483
00:21:34,680 --> 00:21:36,590
I can also learn a lot from you.

484
00:21:36,590 --> 00:21:38,590
If I learn from him,

485
00:21:39,200 --> 00:21:39,830
I...

486
00:21:40,680 --> 00:21:41,920
He won't think I'm good enough.

487
00:21:43,680 --> 00:21:45,200
No one in Lime

488
00:21:45,750 --> 00:21:47,510
is good enough for him.

489
00:21:48,920 --> 00:21:50,920
Join us for dinner tonight.

490
00:21:51,510 --> 00:21:52,920
Don't wear this outfit.

491
00:21:53,030 --> 00:21:54,680
I have a nice dress for you.

492
00:21:58,680 --> 00:21:59,440
Today,

493
00:21:59,960 --> 00:22:02,200
I must thank Luke

494
00:22:02,200 --> 00:22:04,030
