495
00:22:04,830 --> 00:22:05,920
That's too much praise, Mr. Li.

496
00:22:06,440 --> 00:22:08,960
I must thank Laiyu.

497
00:22:09,270 --> 00:22:10,790
Your ad quality is excellent.

498
00:22:10,920 --> 00:22:12,400
The client is also showing gratitude

499
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:14,510
and hoping for long-term collaboration among us.

500
00:22:15,270 --> 00:22:16,310
Everyone, let's have a toast!

501
00:22:16,310 --> 00:22:16,920
Together!

502
00:22:16,920 --> 00:22:17,680
Cheers.

503
00:22:23,310 --> 00:22:25,720
Shang Zhitao.

504
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:27,030
Did I remember your name right?

505
00:22:27,200 --> 00:22:28,270
Yes, Mr. Li.

506
00:22:29,750 --> 00:22:30,440
Come,

507
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:31,680
Ms. Shang.

508
00:22:31,680 --> 00:22:34,240
It's all thanks to you for making this partnership a success.

509
00:22:34,720 --> 00:22:35,270
Come.

510
00:22:35,440 --> 00:22:36,510
A toast to you.

511
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:38,680
Mr. Li, I...

512
00:22:38,790 --> 00:22:40,510
