513
00:22:41,590 --> 00:22:42,400
How can you not drink

514
00:22:42,400 --> 00:22:44,750
when you're in the advertising business?

515
00:22:45,240 --> 00:22:46,360
Besides,

516
00:22:46,360 --> 00:22:48,050
you either drink or you don't.

517
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:49,560
Not knowing how to drink is nonsense.

518
00:22:51,370 --> 00:22:51,960
Cheers.

519
00:22:56,790 --> 00:22:59,160
Ms. Shang, you're indeed an exceptional woman.

520
00:22:59,790 --> 00:23:01,160
Where are you from?

521
00:23:01,750 --> 00:23:03,790
I'm from Harbin.

522
00:23:04,270 --> 00:23:05,830
Women from the Northeast

523
00:23:06,030 --> 00:23:07,590
are all attractive.

524
00:23:08,200 --> 00:23:09,070
You also carry

525
00:23:09,070 --> 00:23:11,160
the grace of a woman from the South.

526
00:23:11,270 --> 00:23:12,440
Are you single?

527
00:23:15,070 --> 00:23:15,830
Mr. Li,

528
00:23:15,830 --> 00:23:17,400
