529
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:18,680
You...

530
00:23:19,200 --> 00:23:20,680
I'm from Beijing.

531
00:23:20,790 --> 00:23:22,880
Let me offer you a toast on behalf of the capital's people.

532
00:23:22,880 --> 00:23:23,440
Cheers.

533
00:23:23,600 --> 00:23:24,160
You are...

534
00:23:24,160 --> 00:23:25,160
Let me do it.

535
00:23:27,440 --> 00:23:28,510
Flora,

536
00:23:28,550 --> 00:23:30,160
