537
00:23:30,160 --> 00:23:31,200
Make sure you're sober.

538
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:32,680
If you submit it late,

539
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:34,270
Mr. Luan will chew you out.

540
00:23:34,590 --> 00:23:35,680
That's right, Mr. Li.

541
00:23:35,680 --> 00:23:37,260
I still need to write a report later.

542
00:23:38,750 --> 00:23:39,860
Does Lime

543
00:23:40,680 --> 00:23:42,550
