544
00:23:43,590 --> 00:23:44,240
Come.

545
00:23:44,720 --> 00:23:46,070
You can't leave, Flora.

546
00:23:47,750 --> 00:23:49,200
Go and listen to the conference call.

547
00:23:49,270 --> 00:23:50,590
It'll help with your report.

548
00:23:52,240 --> 00:23:52,750
All right.

549
00:23:54,510 --> 00:23:55,400
Don't answer any calls

550
00:23:55,960 --> 00:23:56,960
