551
00:24:03,030 --> 00:24:03,590
Let me fill your glass.

552
00:24:03,590 --> 00:24:04,720
Sure. Thanks.

553
00:24:05,200 --> 00:24:06,790
Director, a toast to you.

554
00:24:06,790 --> 00:24:07,640
Sure.

555
00:24:10,830 --> 00:24:11,830
You are quite protective

556
00:24:12,000 --> 00:24:13,440
