567
00:25:18,030 --> 00:25:18,960
Luke.

568
00:25:19,310 --> 00:25:21,510
Thank you for saving me from all that drinking today.

569
00:25:22,110 --> 00:25:23,200
I've learned a lot

570
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:24,550
