571
00:25:26,550 --> 00:25:27,440
If you can't drink,

572
00:25:27,920 --> 00:25:29,000
don't even take a sip.

573
00:25:29,440 --> 00:25:31,070
Not everyone deserves a toast.

574
00:25:33,160 --> 00:25:33,830
All right.

575
00:25:37,680 --> 00:25:38,830
Let me get us a ride.

576
00:25:39,400 --> 00:25:40,000
We'll walk back

577
00:25:41,200 --> 00:25:42,200
to get rid of the smell of alcohol.

578
00:26:33,960 --> 00:26:34,750
No need.

579
00:26:37,200 --> 00:26:38,160
Put it on.

580
00:26:39,030 --> 00:26:39,750
I feel warm.

581
00:26:48,640 --> 00:26:49,640
Thank you, Luke.

582
00:26:55,920 --> 00:26:56,750
Flora.

583
00:26:57,920 --> 00:26:59,830
If a client asks whether you're single or not next time,

584
00:27:00,440 --> 00:27:01,500
how will you answer?

585
00:27:02,720 --> 00:27:04,030
I'll just be honest

586
00:27:04,200 --> 00:27:04,830
and say I'm single.

587
00:27:06,440 --> 00:27:07,750
Are you trying to tell him

588
00:27:08,030 --> 00:27:09,070
that he has a chance?

589
00:27:14,920 --> 00:27:15,790
Luke,

590
00:27:15,960 --> 00:27:17,510
are you single?

591
00:27:18,960 --> 00:27:19,720
Yes.

592
00:27:20,200 --> 00:27:21,790
Are you also telling me

593
00:27:21,790 --> 00:27:22,920
that I have a chance?

594
00:27:27,270 --> 00:27:28,960
If you're drunk, go back and sleep.

595
00:27:29,550 --> 00:27:30,680
You'll find what you want in your dream.

596
00:28:04,880 --> 00:28:06,070
Luan Nian!

597
00:28:07,680 --> 00:28:08,310
Zang Yao?

598
00:28:16,510 --> 00:28:18,000
Are you surprised?

599
00:28:18,000 --> 00:28:19,270
Why are you here?

600
00:28:19,440 --> 00:28:20,160
What?

601
00:28:20,160 --> 00:28:21,440
Am I not welcome here?

602
00:28:21,550 --> 00:28:22,510
No.

603
00:28:23,030 --> 00:28:24,920
I mean, how do you know I'm here?

604
00:28:25,590 --> 00:28:27,030
Seriously.

605
00:28:27,160 --> 00:28:28,240
If Chen Kuannian hadn't told me

606
00:28:28,240 --> 00:28:29,270
that you were in Guangzhou on a business trip,

607
00:28:29,270 --> 00:28:30,510
I wouldn't have known.

608
00:28:30,830 --> 00:28:32,270
It's an urgent business trip.

609
00:28:32,440 --> 00:28:33,070
I'm in a rush

610
00:28:33,070 --> 00:28:34,240
and will go back tomorrow.

611
00:28:34,880 --> 00:28:36,920
I'm going out to drink with Chen.

612
00:28:36,960 --> 00:28:37,550
Join us for another round.

613
00:28:37,680 --> 00:28:38,270
Let's go.

614
00:28:38,680 --> 00:28:39,480
I'm not going.

615
00:28:40,030 --> 00:28:41,160
I still have important work to do.

616
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:43,920
Don't drive if you drink.

617
00:28:44,200 --> 00:28:46,480
Ask Chen or your boyfriend to drive you back.

618
00:28:47,000 --> 00:28:48,720
What a party pooper.

619
00:28:49,510 --> 00:28:50,550
We already broke up.

620
00:28:52,000 --> 00:28:53,160
Again?

621
00:28:53,830 --> 00:28:55,590
What? I'm just learning from you.

622
00:28:55,830 --> 00:28:57,270
Of all things, why learn that from me?

623
00:28:58,270 --> 00:28:59,400
Why did you break up?

624
00:29:00,070 --> 00:29:01,960
Why are you acting like my dad?

625
00:29:01,960 --> 00:29:03,270
You ask too many questions.

626
00:29:04,000 --> 00:29:05,720
Enough. Just go back to work.

627
00:29:05,790 --> 00:29:06,720
I'm telling you.

628
00:29:06,720 --> 00:29:08,750
I'm going to Beijing next month.

629
00:29:08,750 --> 00:29:10,720
You must find time to accompany me, no matter what.

630
00:29:10,720 --> 00:29:11,320
All right?

631
00:29:11,750 --> 00:29:12,680
Why are you going back to Beijing?

632
00:29:13,200 --> 00:29:14,830
What? Am I not welcome there?

633
00:29:15,510 --> 00:29:16,510
Of course, you are.

634
00:29:16,750 --> 00:29:18,270
I'll treat you to dinner when you're back.

635
00:29:19,000 --> 00:29:20,920
You two

636
00:29:20,920 --> 00:29:23,720
were walking along the Pearl River late at night.

637
00:29:23,720 --> 00:29:24,310
Tao,

638
00:29:24,440 --> 00:29:26,440
I think something might happen

639
00:29:26,720 --> 00:29:28,590
between you and your boss.

640
00:29:28,590 --> 00:29:29,830
What?

641
00:29:30,000 --> 00:29:31,200
Didn't you say

642
00:29:31,510 --> 00:29:33,720
he helped you deflect drinks and got you out of a tight spot

643
00:29:33,790 --> 00:29:35,510
and gave you his jacket?

644
00:29:37,790 --> 00:29:39,960
That's because he is a gentleman.

645
00:29:40,310 --> 00:29:42,030
Is Luan Nian handsome?

646
00:29:44,750 --> 00:29:47,240
The kind of roguishly handsome type.

647
00:29:47,400 --> 00:29:49,510
Moreover, he has many women around him.

648
00:29:50,510 --> 00:29:51,510
You're right.

649
00:29:51,680 --> 00:29:54,400
A high-quality elite bachelor

650
00:29:54,400 --> 00:29:57,270
will be surrounded by women.

651
00:29:57,440 --> 00:29:58,830
But don't give up.

652
00:29:59,270 --> 00:30:00,510
You aren't bad.

653
00:30:00,590 --> 00:30:02,750
You have a nice body, and you're pretty.

654
00:30:03,200 --> 00:30:04,550
That's enough, Sun Yu.

655
00:30:04,750 --> 00:30:05,920
I still have a report to rush.

656
00:30:05,920 --> 00:30:07,030
I'll talk to you later.

657
00:30:11,780 --> 00:30:13,140
[Luan Nian: Are you not going to return my jacket?]

658
00:30:16,860 --> 00:30:19,260
[Which room are you in?]

659
00:30:30,070 --> 00:30:31,110
Luke.

660
00:30:31,310 --> 00:30:33,160
Sorry for disturbing you so late at night.

661
00:30:33,240 --> 00:30:34,750
Thank you for lending me your jacket.

662
00:30:35,510 --> 00:30:36,440
Come in.

663
00:30:36,440 --> 00:30:37,070
No.

664
00:30:37,510 --> 00:30:39,240
I shouldn't enter your room.

665
00:30:39,680 --> 00:30:41,270
If someone sees us so late at night,

666
00:30:41,270 --> 00:30:42,270
it will be hard to explain.

667
00:30:42,270 --> 00:30:43,750
It'll damage your reputation.

668
00:30:44,270 --> 00:30:45,510
Are you from the past or what?

669
00:30:55,640 --> 00:30:56,880
Give this to Lumi tomorrow morning.

670
00:31:08,110 --> 00:31:09,680
What are you thinking?

671
00:31:11,480 --> 00:31:12,110
I...

672
00:31:13,880 --> 00:31:15,270
I think

673
00:31:15,920 --> 00:31:18,070
it might be inconvenient if someone is in your room.

674
00:31:27,590 --> 00:31:29,200
Am I some sort of

675
00:31:29,200 --> 00:31:30,160
pervert

676
00:31:30,160 --> 00:31:31,830
in your mind?

677
00:31:32,590 --> 00:31:34,000
No.

678
00:31:42,160 --> 00:31:43,720
If you have time to do that,

679
00:31:43,960 --> 00:31:45,790
you should reflect on your work again.

680
00:31:45,790 --> 00:31:47,270
In the workplace, only results can speak for you.

681
00:31:47,590 --> 00:31:49,030
Go back and think about

682
00:31:49,270 --> 00:31:50,790
how to improve.

683
00:31:51,070 --> 00:31:51,560
Go back.

684
00:31:54,400 --> 00:31:55,790
I'll go back and reflect on my work

685
00:31:55,790 --> 00:31:56,790
and send it to you.

686
00:31:56,790 --> 00:31:57,960
Please guide me.

687
00:31:58,310 --> 00:31:59,510
Why are you sending it to me?

688
00:32:00,310 --> 00:32:01,720
Am I your mentor or what?

689
00:32:04,720 --> 00:32:05,550
You're still not leaving?

690
00:32:18,020 --> 00:32:21,300
[Canton Hotel]

691
00:32:22,760 --> 00:32:23,450
It's done, sir.

692
00:32:24,200 --> 00:32:24,750
Thank you.

693
00:32:24,750 --> 00:32:25,400
Boss.

694
00:32:25,760 --> 00:32:26,200
Here you go.

695
00:32:30,960 --> 00:32:31,440
Is it done?

696
00:32:31,440 --> 00:32:32,070
Yes.

697
00:32:33,310 --> 00:32:33,960
Is it done?

698
00:32:35,920 --> 00:32:36,720
Thank you.

699
00:32:36,750 --> 00:32:37,310
You're welcome.

700
00:32:37,680 --> 00:32:38,920
We got the deal,

701
00:32:39,160 --> 00:32:42,200
but we're in trouble again when coming up with a proposal later.

702
00:32:42,590 --> 00:32:43,590
Lumi,

703
00:32:43,830 --> 00:32:46,070
can I become the assistant to the PM for this project?

704
00:32:47,070 --> 00:32:47,960
Sure.

705
00:32:48,240 --> 00:32:49,400
If you think you can handle it, just go for it.

706
00:32:55,790 --> 00:32:56,750
I'm back.

707
00:32:57,200 --> 00:32:58,440
Tao, you're back.

708
00:32:58,440 --> 00:33:00,240
Just in time.

709
00:33:00,240 --> 00:33:01,030
Lei,

710
00:33:01,510 --> 00:33:03,680
I've not seen Shang Zhitao come back for dinner

711
00:33:03,680 --> 00:33:06,750
for a long time.

712
00:33:06,750 --> 00:33:07,830
Shang Zhitao?

713
00:33:08,030 --> 00:33:08,790
Hello.

714
00:33:08,790 --> 00:33:09,510
Lei.

715
00:33:09,510 --> 00:33:10,030
I'm Zhang Lei.

716
00:33:10,030 --> 00:33:10,750
Hello, Lei.

717
00:33:10,750 --> 00:33:12,790
I've finally met our landlord.

718
00:33:14,400 --> 00:33:14,920
Wow,

719
00:33:14,920 --> 00:33:15,960
what a feast.

720
00:33:15,960 --> 00:33:16,680
Sit down, quickly.

721
00:33:17,720 --> 00:33:19,400
I didn't help out at all today.

722
00:33:19,400 --> 00:33:20,720
Let me do the dishes, all right?

723
00:33:21,240 --> 00:33:21,920
How much should I pay?

724
00:33:21,960 --> 00:33:22,960
Who should I transfer to?

725
00:33:22,960 --> 00:33:23,590
No need.

726
00:33:23,590 --> 00:33:24,920
Let Lei and me treat everyone.

727
00:33:24,960 --> 00:33:26,920
We must take care of each other when we're living outside.

728
00:33:27,590 --> 00:33:29,640
Most importantly, it doesn't cost much.

729
00:33:29,920 --> 00:33:31,200
Let's have a toast first

730
00:33:31,200 --> 00:33:33,270
to celebrate our landlord's return.

731
00:33:33,840 --> 00:33:35,200
Welcome!

732
00:33:35,200 --> 00:33:36,200
Thank you, everyone.

733
00:33:38,440 --> 00:33:40,680
Lei, you've been working abroad for two months.

734
00:33:40,680 --> 00:33:41,830
Right?

735
00:33:41,830 --> 00:33:43,920
The project was running for too long.

736
00:33:44,440 --> 00:33:45,510
I've not come home for two months.

737
00:33:45,510 --> 00:33:46,200
Thanks, babe.

738
00:33:46,200 --> 00:33:46,960
I'm so exhausted.

739
00:33:47,830 --> 00:33:49,920
But I can see that you three are getting along well.

740
00:33:49,920 --> 00:33:50,510
Thank you.

741
00:33:50,510 --> 00:33:51,510
Of course.

742
00:33:51,510 --> 00:33:52,920
These two people are nice.

743
00:33:53,200 --> 00:33:54,000
They are

744
00:33:54,000 --> 00:33:56,000
the stars in the sky

745
00:33:56,000 --> 00:33:57,830
compared to those two who only deserve to live in the basement.

746
00:33:57,830 --> 00:33:58,920
Really?

747
00:33:59,110 --> 00:34:00,440
Shang Zhitao,

748
00:34:00,590 --> 00:34:01,750
it's our first meeting.

749
00:34:01,920 --> 00:34:04,200
I didn't prepare any gift for you.

750
00:34:04,240 --> 00:34:04,920
Well,

751
00:34:05,160 --> 00:34:05,830
I'll give you

752
00:34:06,160 --> 00:34:07,440
a discount of 100 yuan on your rent.

753
00:34:07,920 --> 00:34:09,070
Really?

754
00:34:10,140 --> 00:34:11,510
You didn't give me the same favor.

755
00:34:12,670 --> 00:34:14,190
You took care of the house well.

756
00:34:14,670 --> 00:34:15,670
I'll give you a 50-yuan discount.

757
00:34:16,440 --> 00:34:17,670
Not bad.

758
00:34:21,590 --> 00:34:22,710
Everyone will get a 100-yuan discount!

759
00:34:23,440 --> 00:34:24,440
Thank you, Lei.

760
00:34:24,440 --> 00:34:26,440
Thank you, Landlord.

761
00:34:26,960 --> 00:34:27,760
Cheers!

762
00:34:30,150 --> 00:34:31,200
Hurry and eat.

763
00:34:32,110 --> 00:34:32,610
Lei.

764
00:34:33,230 --> 00:34:33,670
Thank you.

765
00:34:33,670 --> 00:34:34,840
You can hold your liquor.

766
00:34:34,840 --> 00:34:35,760
- Lei. - Cheers!

767
00:34:35,760 --> 00:34:36,670
Thanks, Landlord.

768
00:34:36,670 --> 00:34:37,670
The meat is ready.

769
00:34:37,670 --> 00:34:39,190
Do you still want that discount?

770
00:34:47,800 --> 00:34:48,670
Flora,

771
00:34:48,670 --> 00:34:50,280
have you reminded Luke

772
00:34:50,280 --> 00:34:51,510
to approve the business trip expenses?

773
00:34:51,510 --> 00:34:52,590
Why hasn't it been approved yet?

774
00:34:52,800 --> 00:34:54,280
I'm going to make a claim on Monday.

775
00:34:54,320 --> 00:34:56,440
I sent it to him, but he didn't give me a reply.

776
00:34:56,440 --> 00:34:57,800
Rush him again.

777
00:34:58,000 --> 00:34:59,920
Otherwise, just call him.

778
00:35:02,030 --> 00:35:03,280
Sure.

779
00:35:04,230 --> 00:35:05,230
Don't be scared.

780
00:35:05,440 --> 00:35:07,230
Rushing your boss will help you gain experience.

781
00:35:07,510 --> 00:35:08,320
I'm counting on you.

782
00:35:08,590 --> 00:35:09,320
Bye.

783
00:35:30,280 --> 00:35:31,480
Hello, Luke.

784
00:35:31,480 --> 00:35:33,150
[Shang Zhitao]
Sorry for disturbing you this late.

785
00:35:33,150 --> 00:35:35,440
I have a few things to confirm with you.

786
00:35:35,440 --> 00:35:37,480
Also, I need you to approve

787
00:35:37,480 --> 00:35:38,670
an OA budget.

788
00:35:40,670 --> 00:35:41,920
What's the rush for payment?

789
00:35:42,150 --> 00:35:43,150
Even if I approve it at night,

790
00:35:43,320 --> 00:35:44,670
will the finance department pay you?

791
00:35:52,740 --> 00:35:55,340
[Re: Budget Approval - Fund request. Payment approved.]

792
00:35:55,340 --> 00:35:56,020
[Send]

793
00:35:57,700 --> 00:35:59,300
[Luke: Payment approved.]

794
00:36:04,400 --> 00:36:05,400
Thank you.

795
00:36:05,630 --> 00:36:06,510
I've learned a lot.

796
00:36:06,670 --> 00:36:07,760
Thank you for the hard work.

797
00:36:09,190 --> 00:36:10,670
I'll go back and reflect on my work

798
00:36:10,670 --> 00:36:11,670
and send it to you.

799
00:36:11,670 --> 00:36:13,000
Please guide me.

800
00:36:18,960 --> 00:36:20,670
Do you need anything else from me?

801
00:36:24,880 --> 00:36:25,670
There's more,

802
00:36:25,670 --> 00:36:26,840
but it's not urgent.

803
00:36:26,840 --> 00:36:28,030
It's late.

804
00:36:28,030 --> 00:36:29,630
I won't disturb your rest any further.

805
00:36:30,140 --> 00:36:33,020
[Shang Zhitao]

806
00:36:36,940 --> 00:36:38,420
[Luan Nian]

807
00:36:40,880 --> 00:36:41,670
Luke.

808
00:36:42,630 --> 00:36:44,480
Are you going to disturb me tomorrow, then?

809
00:36:46,070 --> 00:36:47,880
I left some documents at the office.

810
00:36:47,880 --> 00:36:49,030
I'm afraid you might not see them.

811
00:36:49,030 --> 00:36:50,510
I'm at the office now.

812
00:36:50,760 --> 00:36:52,320
What else do you need me for?

813
00:36:52,320 --> 00:36:53,150
Tell me everything in one go.

814
00:36:54,150 --> 00:36:55,480
Also,

815
00:36:55,710 --> 00:36:58,320
the filming venue needs your approval.

816
00:36:58,320 --> 00:36:59,630
I sent it to your secretary.

817
00:36:59,630 --> 00:37:01,360
I'll confirm with the client on Monday.

818
00:37:02,150 --> 00:37:03,070
Also,

819
00:37:03,360 --> 00:37:05,360
I sent the filming material and budget

820
00:37:05,360 --> 00:37:07,550
usage progress to you.

821
00:37:07,840 --> 00:37:09,000
They require your approval.

822
00:37:09,510 --> 00:37:10,960
Go and find Jack tomorrow.

823
00:37:13,030 --> 00:37:13,920
Then,

824
00:37:14,360 --> 00:37:16,320
there's nothing else for now.

825
00:37:16,320 --> 00:37:17,030
Sorry

826
00:37:17,400 --> 00:37:18,440
for disturbing you.

827
00:37:19,880 --> 00:37:20,630
It's all right.

828
00:37:20,630 --> 00:37:22,000
Thank you for the hard work.

829
00:37:22,280 --> 00:37:23,360
Good night.

830
00:37:30,820 --> 00:37:32,500
[Shang Zhitao]

831
00:37:37,000 --> 00:37:37,880
You're still not hanging up?

832
00:37:38,150 --> 00:37:39,030
Are you eavesdropping?

833
00:37:39,630 --> 00:37:40,360
Workplace etiquette.

834
00:37:40,360 --> 00:37:41,400
The boss should hang up first.

835
00:37:41,840 --> 00:37:43,000
Workplace etiquette?

836
00:37:45,510 --> 00:37:46,360
Fine.

837
00:37:46,880 --> 00:37:48,000
I should have hung up sooner.

838
00:37:55,960 --> 00:37:56,960
Patience

839
00:37:57,510 --> 00:37:59,190
is probably her strength.

840
00:38:05,400 --> 00:38:06,630
Are you still working so late at night?

841
00:38:06,630 --> 00:38:07,280
Yes.

842
00:38:07,280 --> 00:38:09,360
I'm rushing my boss to approve a budget.

843
00:38:09,510 --> 00:38:10,550
How is it? Are you done?

844
00:38:10,550 --> 00:38:11,190
Done.

845
00:38:11,190 --> 00:38:12,070
That's great.

846
00:38:12,630 --> 00:38:13,400
In my opinion,

847
00:38:13,400 --> 00:38:15,960
being in a workplace is like being in a relationship.

848
00:38:16,000 --> 00:38:18,030
The boss tortures me thousands of times,

849
00:38:18,030 --> 00:38:20,630
but I still treat him like my first love.

850
00:38:23,110 --> 00:38:24,030
My experience tells me

851
00:38:24,030 --> 00:38:25,590
that first loves don't end well.

852
00:38:25,880 --> 00:38:27,800
You must not have any feelings

853
00:38:27,800 --> 00:38:29,630
toward your boss.

854
00:38:30,360 --> 00:38:31,670
Don't scare her.

855
00:38:31,670 --> 00:38:33,150
A boss isn't God.

856
00:38:33,150 --> 00:38:34,800
He just has a few more years of experience

857
00:38:34,800 --> 00:38:36,190
compared to you.

858
00:38:36,190 --> 00:38:37,320
You work so hard.

859
00:38:37,360 --> 00:38:38,630
I'm sure your efforts will be seen one day.

860
00:38:39,280 --> 00:38:41,400
I'm not as hardworking as my boss.

861
00:38:41,400 --> 00:38:43,360
He is still working overtime in the office now.

862
00:38:43,630 --> 00:38:45,510
He's talented and hardworking.

863
00:38:46,190 --> 00:38:47,070
Going to work

864
00:38:47,070 --> 00:38:49,000
feels like the college entrance examination for me.

865
00:38:49,000 --> 00:38:50,320
I dare not get a single question wrong.

866
00:38:51,360 --> 00:38:52,510
Working

867
00:38:52,670 --> 00:38:54,110
is not like running a marathon.

868
00:38:54,510 --> 00:38:56,150
You don't have to be on the same path as your boss.

869
00:38:56,630 --> 00:38:57,920
Just be a blade of grass.

870
00:38:58,630 --> 00:39:00,110
Even if he has a temper,

871
00:39:00,280 --> 00:39:01,960
you can still grow on the ground.

872
00:39:02,360 --> 00:39:03,750
Bouncing back after a storm.

873
00:39:06,070 --> 00:39:08,630
A rookie's greatest strength isn't experience,

874
00:39:08,630 --> 00:39:10,510
but the vigor to grow wildly.

875
00:39:10,840 --> 00:39:12,550
Moss flowers as small as a grain of rice

876
00:39:12,630 --> 00:39:14,070
also bloom like the peony.

877
00:39:14,550 --> 00:39:17,510
You are just like a seed now.

878
00:39:18,030 --> 00:39:20,360
No one can stop you once you grow out of the ground.

879
00:39:20,960 --> 00:39:23,000
Well said.

880
00:39:23,510 --> 00:39:24,630
I heard it from a scholar...

881
00:39:24,630 --> 00:39:25,410
I mean, I learned it.

882
00:39:25,800 --> 00:39:27,400
Blooming like the roses or something.

883
00:39:27,400 --> 00:39:28,510
Peony.

884
00:39:28,510 --> 00:39:29,360
Peony.

885
00:39:29,510 --> 00:39:29,950
I'm telling you.

886
00:39:29,950 --> 00:39:32,070
Hiring people isn't like opening a mystery box.

887
00:39:32,070 --> 00:39:34,110
No one will hire you if you don't have some hidden skills.

888
00:39:34,110 --> 00:39:34,840
Exactly.

889
00:39:34,840 --> 00:39:35,630
I can see

890
00:39:35,630 --> 00:39:37,190
that your hidden skills just haven't been developed yet.

891
00:39:37,190 --> 00:39:37,800
Is that so?

892
00:39:37,800 --> 00:39:38,440
That's right.

893
00:39:40,800 --> 00:39:41,510
How great.

894
00:39:42,030 --> 00:39:43,880
If luck can be ranked,

895
00:39:43,880 --> 00:39:45,670
my luck must be ranked first.

896
00:39:46,030 --> 00:39:48,400
No matter how hard my job is,

897
00:39:48,400 --> 00:39:50,110
I still have my friends to support me.

898
00:39:50,400 --> 00:39:52,000
I'm back to my energetic self again.

899
00:39:52,000 --> 00:39:53,110
You're a good student.

900
00:39:53,320 --> 00:39:54,550
Next meal's on you.

901
00:39:55,550 --> 00:39:56,150
No.

902
00:39:56,710 --> 00:39:57,630
I'm not paying.

903
00:39:57,630 --> 00:39:58,710
You'll never amount to much.

904
00:39:59,000 --> 00:40:00,110
Lei.

905
00:40:00,190 --> 00:40:01,000
Next meal's on you.

906
00:40:01,000 --> 00:40:02,000
Don't look at me.

907
00:40:02,000 --> 00:40:03,360
It's still your treat.

908
00:40:03,360 --> 00:40:04,070
Your treat?

909
00:40:04,070 --> 00:40:04,630
My treat?

910
00:40:04,630 --> 00:40:05,190
Your treat.

911
00:40:05,190 --> 00:40:06,510
Mala crawfish.

912
00:40:11,820 --> 00:40:14,340
[Lime Advertising]

913
00:40:17,000 --> 00:40:17,840
The coffee machine is over there.

914
00:40:17,840 --> 00:40:19,340
Your office is quite impressive.

915
00:40:23,510 --> 00:40:25,960
I finally realized what's wrong with this.

916
00:40:27,280 --> 00:40:29,920
This proposal lacks a concrete approach to address the pain points.

917
00:40:30,590 --> 00:40:32,590
Didn't you ask me to amend it

918
00:40:32,590 --> 00:40:34,030
to increase the value?

919
00:40:34,030 --> 00:40:34,700
That's right.

920
00:40:34,700 --> 00:40:36,550
This version is too conceptual.

921
00:40:36,550 --> 00:40:37,400
It's too abstract.

922
00:40:37,400 --> 00:40:38,360
Do you understand?

923
00:40:39,190 --> 00:40:41,670
But our direction previously

924
00:40:41,670 --> 00:40:44,150
was focusing on Mulanshuo and Taobao's collaboration

925
00:40:44,150 --> 00:40:45,920
to show the advantage

926
00:40:45,920 --> 00:40:47,840
of fast delivery, powered by their extensive logistics networks.

927
00:40:47,840 --> 00:40:49,480
If we suddenly change to something else,

928
00:40:49,480 --> 00:40:50,230
won't it

929
00:40:50,400 --> 00:40:52,070
create confusion about the project's focus?

930
00:40:52,360 --> 00:40:53,350
Moreover, the whole direction

931
00:40:53,350 --> 00:40:54,600
- is different. - Are you teaching me how to do things?

932
00:40:56,670 --> 00:40:58,190
Regardless of the project's direction,

933
00:40:58,190 --> 00:41:00,030
we must improve it

934
00:41:00,030 --> 00:41:01,400
to make it perfect.

935
00:41:01,400 --> 00:41:02,880
Ask the creative division to come up with a few drafts

936
00:41:02,880 --> 00:41:04,320
so we can compare them.

937
00:41:04,320 --> 00:41:06,360
You are a rookie. You might not know

938
00:41:06,360 --> 00:41:08,840
that creativity comes from making amendments.

939
00:41:08,900 --> 00:41:09,680
Why don't I

940
00:41:09,680 --> 00:41:10,550
ask Luke's opinion?

941
00:41:10,550 --> 00:41:11,360
If you ask your boss about everything,

942
00:41:11,360 --> 00:41:12,180
what's the point of having us?

943
00:41:12,880 --> 00:41:13,920
Besides,

944
00:41:13,920 --> 00:41:15,760
there'll never be a final draft in a good proposal.

945
00:41:15,760 --> 00:41:17,240
It can always be amended before it is shot.

946
00:41:17,240 --> 00:41:18,200
Flora.

947
00:41:19,070 --> 00:41:20,550
Go and ask Luke.

948
00:41:20,550 --> 00:41:22,200
Ask the decision maker.

949
00:41:23,280 --> 00:41:24,200
Lumi, what's the meaning of this?

950
00:41:24,200 --> 00:41:25,200
I mean what I said.

951
00:41:27,590 --> 00:41:29,800
Luke approved this project's creative idea.

952
00:41:30,070 --> 00:41:32,510
If he finds out how you waste his efforts,

953
00:41:32,590 --> 00:41:34,200
who do you think will be in trouble?

954
00:41:35,280 --> 00:41:36,590
A rookie?

955
00:41:36,880 --> 00:41:38,200
Haven't you been a rookie before?

956
00:41:38,760 --> 00:41:40,070
If you keep making amendments,

957
00:41:40,240 --> 00:41:42,070
can you take responsibility

958
00:41:42,280 --> 00:41:43,280
for delaying the progress?

959
00:41:45,070 --> 00:41:46,030
Well,

960
00:41:46,070 --> 00:41:47,550
let me ask Luke.

961
00:41:47,630 --> 00:41:49,550
I'll take responsibility if anything happens.

962
00:41:59,430 --> 00:42:00,110
Come in.

963
00:42:01,070 --> 00:42:01,950
Luke.

964
00:42:06,360 --> 00:42:07,110
Luke.

965
00:42:07,110 --> 00:42:10,280
It's time for the execution phase of the creative idea.

966
00:42:10,280 --> 00:42:11,720
There's a delay in the progress.

967
00:42:11,760 --> 00:42:13,110
There have been ongoing opinions.

968
00:42:13,110 --> 00:42:14,430
Didn't I approve the proposal?

969
00:42:14,760 --> 00:42:15,800
Why are there so many opinions?

970
00:42:15,920 --> 00:42:17,720
That's not an issue.

971
00:42:17,720 --> 00:42:19,630
I'm just worried that our direction is wrong.

972
00:42:20,510 --> 00:42:21,630
How many drafts have been made?

973
00:42:22,590 --> 00:42:23,920
Seven or eight drafts.

974
00:42:24,070 --> 00:42:25,470
Completing a project on schedule

975
00:42:25,720 --> 00:42:27,720
is also an important assessment criterion for a PM.

976
00:42:28,070 --> 00:42:28,950
I know.

977
00:42:29,070 --> 00:42:30,110
It's my mistake.

978
00:42:30,110 --> 00:42:31,470
These are the revision comments.

979
00:42:31,470 --> 00:42:32,200
Do you want to take a look?

980
00:42:32,200 --> 00:42:33,110
I'll follow up on the progress.

981
00:42:33,200 --> 00:42:34,070
No.

982
00:42:34,590 --> 00:42:36,030
Go back and create a work group.

983
00:42:36,030 --> 00:42:38,070
Anyone can raise their opinions in the group.

984
00:42:38,070 --> 00:42:39,430
Every round of communication going forward

985
00:42:39,430 --> 00:42:40,550
must be recorded in an email.

986
00:42:40,990 --> 00:42:42,630
Wouldn't it be too formal

987
00:42:42,950 --> 00:42:44,510
to record every conversation in an email?

988
00:42:46,880 --> 00:42:47,590
Formal?

989
00:42:49,280 --> 00:42:50,550
Is the workplace some kind of child's play?

990
00:42:51,400 --> 00:42:52,590
Having it in writing

991
00:42:52,760 --> 00:42:54,110
is what protects you.

992
00:42:56,150 --> 00:42:56,990
Got it.

993
00:42:56,990 --> 00:42:58,990
Can I add you to the group?

994
00:42:58,990 --> 00:43:00,280
You don't need to speak.

995
00:43:01,550 --> 00:43:04,200
Summarize the work discussed in the group and send it via email.

996
00:43:04,470 --> 00:43:06,920
The email must be concise. Highlight the important points in red.

997
00:43:07,280 --> 00:43:08,550
CC the related people.

998
00:43:08,720 --> 00:43:09,360
Got it.

999
00:43:09,680 --> 00:43:10,990
I'll do as you say.

1000
00:43:13,280 --> 00:43:15,200
The golden rule of workplace communication

1001
00:43:15,880 --> 00:43:17,840
is that whoever proposes must take responsibility.

1002
00:43:18,510 --> 00:43:20,990
The person with an opinion must provide a solution.

1003
00:43:22,200 --> 00:43:24,400
What if they just mention it casually?

1004
00:43:25,200 --> 00:43:26,360
Get him to shut up, then.

1005
00:43:26,400 --> 00:43:27,720
No need for nonsense in the workplace.

1006
00:43:27,950 --> 00:43:29,150
You only need results.

1007
00:43:29,990 --> 00:43:31,680
I got it. Thank you.

1008
00:43:31,880 --> 00:43:32,840
I've learned something else.

1009
00:43:33,200 --> 00:43:34,360
Don't thank me just yet.

1010
00:43:34,680 --> 00:43:36,990
Have you prepared yourself for the commercial shoot?

1011
00:43:38,360 --> 00:43:39,880
Can I really go there?

1012
00:43:39,990 --> 00:43:41,200
Lumi recommended you.

1013
00:43:41,990 --> 00:43:43,200
She specifically requested that you go.

1014
00:43:43,550 --> 00:43:45,470
This time, the filming location is in the mountains.

1015
00:43:45,720 --> 00:43:46,630
The conditions are quite harsh.

1016
00:43:46,720 --> 00:43:47,360
Can you do it?

1017
00:43:47,360 --> 00:43:48,030
I can.

1018
00:43:48,280 --> 00:43:49,430
I don't mind the dirty work.

1019
00:43:54,360 --> 00:43:56,280
Handling the dirty work isn't something to brag about.

1020
00:43:56,360 --> 00:43:57,400
You can do all the work,

1021
00:43:57,470 --> 00:43:58,800
but without the result, it still means nothing.

1022
00:43:59,820 --> 00:44:01,030
- Because... - Only results speak for you.

1023
00:44:01,630 --> 00:44:02,400
I understand.

1024
00:44:06,630 --> 00:44:08,030
I'll charge you a tuition fee next time.

1025
00:44:10,470 --> 00:44:11,760
Goodbye, Luke.

1026
00:44:16,150 --> 00:44:17,510
Hello. Can I clean this room?

1027
00:44:17,510 --> 00:44:18,250
Sure.

1028
00:44:27,280 --> 00:44:28,400
What is this?

1029
00:44:38,280 --> 00:44:39,840
It's probably from the typewriter.

1030
00:44:39,990 --> 00:44:40,920
It's probably useless now.

1031
00:44:41,400 --> 00:44:42,640
No, it's not. Give it to me.

1032
00:44:42,760 --> 00:44:43,400
Okay.

1033
00:44:43,880 --> 00:44:44,880
Thanks, Madam.

1034
00:45:21,110 --> 00:45:22,430
How dare you

1035
00:45:22,630 --> 00:45:24,110
wear my man's clothes?

1036
00:45:25,990 --> 00:45:26,680
I...

1037
00:45:26,680 --> 00:45:27,550
I did not.

1038
00:45:55,620 --> 00:45:58,660
♪One look is all it takes to find the right person♪

1039
00:45:58,660 --> 00:46:01,500
♪One lifetime is all it takes to commemorate this love♪

1040
00:46:02,500 --> 00:46:06,460
♪Whatever remains will be the proof♪

1041
00:46:09,740 --> 00:46:13,100
♪If it never crosses your mind♪

1042
00:46:13,100 --> 00:46:16,820
♪The tide as I turn back♪

1043
00:46:16,820 --> 00:46:21,140
♪Is just formless attraction♪

1044
00:46:22,700 --> 00:46:28,020
♪Your silhouette is closing in♪

1045
00:46:29,860 --> 00:46:35,460
♪Your breathing grows clear♪

1046
00:46:37,020 --> 00:46:41,380
♪Too many distractions in this world♪

1047
00:46:41,380 --> 00:46:46,100
♪I would rather forget myself♪

1048
00:46:46,380 --> 00:46:50,540
♪Just this moment♪

1049
00:46:51,180 --> 00:46:54,580
♪One look is all it takes to find the right person♪

1050
00:46:54,580 --> 00:46:57,500
♪One lifetime is all it takes to commemorate this love♪

1051
00:46:58,340 --> 00:47:02,540
♪If you miss it, just save the traces♪

1052
00:47:05,500 --> 00:47:09,260
♪If your tears fall on their own♪

1053
00:47:09,260 --> 00:47:12,580
♪Followed by our hearts beating to the same rhythm♪

1054
00:47:12,700 --> 00:47:14,860
♪Will you listen to it♪

1055
00:47:14,900 --> 00:47:18,980
♪Or will you reply to me in silence?♪

1056
00:47:19,020 --> 00:47:23,940
♪Your silhouette is closing in♪

1057
00:47:25,900 --> 00:47:32,100
♪Your breathing grows clear♪

1058
00:47:32,900 --> 00:47:37,420
♪Too many distractions in this world♪

1059
00:47:37,500 --> 00:47:42,140
♪I would rather forget myself♪

1060
00:47:42,220 --> 00:47:47,180
♪All I want is to lose myself in this moment♪

1061
00:47:47,500 --> 00:47:53,620
♪Your aloofness masks your vulnerability♪

1062
00:47:54,540 --> 00:48:00,700
♪I hide my nervousness in the corner♪

1063
00:48:01,780 --> 00:48:06,220
♪Too many hurdles in this world♪

1064
00:48:06,260 --> 00:48:10,380
♪Even one moment can keep us warm♪

1065
00:48:10,580 --> 00:48:16,380
♪Just this moment♪

1066
00:48:16,980 --> 00:48:20,300
♪All right?♪
